5:["$","$L15",null,{"url":"https://nmarkdesigns.com/en/blog/kako-da-portfolio-donosi-kvalitetne-upite/","title":"How to make portfolio pages generate better enquiries","labels":{"title":"Share this article","intro":"Send the article to someone who may find it useful.","facebook":"Facebook","linkedin":"LinkedIn","x":"X","instagram":"Instagram","copy":"Copy link","copied":"Link copied.","instagramLabel":"Copy the link for sharing on Instagram","copyLabel":"Copy article link"}}]
6:["$","div",null,{"className":"Blog_body__3F_4b","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"Blog_answer__uX72u","aria-label":"The short answer","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-subheading font-semibold","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A portfolio is more useful when imagery is paired with the task, decision and delivered solution. Add evidence where available, state the limits of what you know and offer a relevant next step. A beautiful screenshot alone leaves too many questions unanswered."}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"Blog_figure__N482F","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Blog_image__Wh83s","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/blog/da-portfolio-ne-bude-galerija.webp","alt":"Illustration of a website portfolio on a laptop and a notebook sketch of the journey from visitor to enquiry.","width":1536,"height":1024,"sizes":"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 65vw"}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"A portfolio should connect project imagery with context and a clear next step."}]]}],[["$","section","Start with the prospective client’s question",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Start with the prospective client’s question"}],[["$","p","Visitors are not looking at a project just to judge its colours. They want to know whether you understand a similar problem, what you actually did and whether your reasoning fits their business.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Visitors are not looking at a project just to judge its colours. They want to know whether you understand a similar problem, what you actually did and whether your reasoning fits their business."}],["$","p","The introduction should therefore name the type of project and its task. Avoid a long technology list before explaining the purpose. Technologies belong later, and only when verified.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"The introduction should therefore name the type of project and its task. Avoid a long technology list before explaining the purpose. Technologies belong later, and only when verified."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","Task → decision → delivery",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Task → decision → delivery"}],[["$","p","This structure separates needs, approach and outcomes you can genuinely show. The task describes the problem. The decision explains a choice. Delivery states what was built without turning an intention into measured business success.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"This structure separates needs, approach and outcomes you can genuinely show. The task describes the problem. The decision explains a choice. Delivery states what was built without turning an intention into measured business success."}],["$","p","An illustrative example, not a claim about a particular client: a language school wants clearer course information. The decision is to group courses by level. The delivery is a level overview with a path to registration. ‘More registrations’ can be added only when supported by appropriate measurement.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"An illustrative example, not a claim about a particular client: a language school wants clearer course information. The decision is to group courses by level. The delivery is a level overview with a path to registration. ‘More registrations’ can be added only when supported by appropriate measurement."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Task: what should the visitor understand or do?",{"children":"Task: what should the visitor understand or do?"}],"$L16","$L17"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"],"$L1b","$L1c"]}]
